# Polylang JS

Import `@wordpress/*` only (`eslint.config.cjs` → `import/core-modules`). Blocks live in `js/src/blocks/`; markup changes go through that block's `deprecated.js`.

```js
import { useSelect } from '@wordpress/data';
```

Paths: `.cursor/reference/js-conventions.md`.
